:: Lake House Assault Wardrobe
<<effects>>

<<if $phase is 2>>
	You enter the lake house, get in your room, and throw open the wadrobe.
<<elseif $phase is 1>>
	You climb from your bed, and throw open the wardrobe.
<<elseif $phase is 3>>
	You enter your room, and throw open the wardrobe.
<<else>>
	You look through the wardrobe.
<</if>>
<<set $phase to 0>>
You hear shouting outside.
<br><br>
<<set $wardrobe_location to "lakehouse">>
<<wardrobeSelection>>
<<wardrobewear>>
<div id="wardrobeExits"><<wardrobeExits>></div>
<<wardrobe>>

:: Lake House Assault Intro
<<effects>>
<<set $bus to "lake house outdoors">>
<<lakehouse_assault_init>>

You rush outside.
<br><br>
<<unset $lakehouse_attack_timer>>

<<if $lakehouse.tower gte 2 and $lakehouse.tower_guard>>
	You wave at the watchtower, and $farm.tower_guard flashes the searchlight in response.
<<elseif $lakehouse.tower and $lakehouse.tower_guard>>
	You wave at the watchtower, and you make out $lakehouse.tower_guard wave in response.
<<elseif $lakehouse.tower>>
	You glance at the watchtower. You can climb it if you need a better view.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<if $lakehouse.guardpost and $lakehouse.post_guard>>
	You glance at the guard post, and $farm.post_guard nods in response.
<<elseif $lakehouse.guardpost>>
	You glance at the guard post. <span class="red">It's empty.</span>
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<if $leftarm is "bound" or $rightarm is "bound">>
	You get rid of your bindings. You're not defending the lake house like that.
	<<unbind>>
	<br><br>
<</if>>

<<link [[Next|Farm Assault]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
